What

00:17:03.455 --> 00:17:05.090
methods do you have for cooling your house

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:06.625
? Summer is coming soon;

00:17:06.625 --> 00:17:08.160
what are some

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.595
