00:17:49.001 --> 00:17:49.401
So in the future,

00:17:49.401 --> 00:17:50.669
for those detached houses

00:17:50.669 --> 00:17:52.171
, or for some new construction projects,

00:17:52.171 --> 00:17:53.972
