00:18:00.779 --> 00:18:01.847
Solar panels have an advantage:

00:18:01.847 --> 00:18:02.915
illegal constructions can be legal.

00:18:02.915 --> 00:18:03.782
But

00:18:03.782 --> 00:18:04.516
