00:18:07.119 --> 00:18:07.686
The rest

00:18:07.686 --> 00:18:09.254
, we'll let the netizens say.

00:18:09.254 --> 00:18:10.422
Look at

00:18:10.422 --> 00:18:11.790
the factory below

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:12.458
, isn't it

00:18:12.458 --> 00:18:13.525
a traditional wind turbine type?

00:18:13.525 --> 00:18:14.693
Go ask them if it leaks.

00:18:14.693 --> 00:18:15.427
Look, that

00:18:15.427 --> 00:18:16.462
one is also traditional.

00:18:16.462 --> 00:18:17.062
Look, is this

00:18:17.062 --> 00:18:17.763
asbestos

00:18:17.763 --> 00:18:18.497
