00:18:21.033 --> 00:18:21.967
There's another thing,

00:18:21.967 --> 00:18:23.035
I think it's on the screen.

00:18:23.035 --> 00:18:23.669
Can you see

00:18:23.669 --> 00:18:24.670
that

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:25.671
stainless steel ladder

00:18:25.671 --> 00:18:27.406
? Guess what it is? A stainless steel ladder

00:18:27.406 --> 00:18:28.040
