00:18:32.711 --> 00:18:34.046
depending on your design.

00:18:34.046 --> 00:18:35.714
Of course, there are different prices in different areas.

00:18:35.714 --> 00:18:36.181
I guess

00:18:36.181 --> 00:18:37.316
in central Taiwan it's around

00:18:37.316 --> 00:18:37.850
70,000 to 80,000.

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:38.684
The shop owner said around 80,000,

00:18:38.684 --> 00:18:39.685
but I guess around 70,000.

00:18:39.685 --> 00:18:40.219
You can see

00:18:40.219 --> 00:18:41.253
I'm a little cheaper than the owner.

00:18:41.253 --> 00:18:41.954
Sometimes, for detached houses

00:18:41.954 --> 00:18:43.088
, to accommodate maintenance

00:18:43.088 --> 00:18:43.989
on the roof

00:18:43.989 --> 00:18:45.958
, your water tower, solar panel heaters

00:18:45.958 --> 00:18:46.959
, solar water heaters

00:18:46.959 --> 00:18:47.626
, heat pumps,

00:18:47.626 --> 00:18:49.361
and other things on the roof,

00:18:49.361 --> 00:18:50.629
you need to leave space behind

00:18:50.629 --> 00:18:51.697
and add a ladder

00:18:51.697 --> 00:18:52.397
to place it.

00:18:52.397 --> 00:18:53.665
This avoids the problems

00:18:53.665 --> 00:18:55.033
we just mentioned, like how

00:18:55.033 --> 00:18:56.201
traditional ladders are hard to move up,

00:18:56.201 --> 00:18:56.702
hard to open

00:18:56.702 --> 00:18:57.369
, and dangerous.

00:18:57.369 --> 00:18:58.137
You have ideas

00:18:58.137 --> 00:18:59.271
,

00:18:59.271 --> 00:19:00.539
but you'd have to spend 70,000 to 80,000.

00:19:00.539 --> 00:19:01.740
Why not install a ladder? Why not

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.675
install a skylight for ventilation and light?

00:19:03.675 --> 00:19:04.109
I think you could

00:19:04.109 --> 00:19:05.277
call it a skylight window; it

00:19:05.277 --> 00:19:06.011
sounds nice. Is there a

00:19:06.011 --> 00:19:06.912
simplified version called a

00:19:06.912 --> 00:19:08.247
ventilation and lighting skylight?

00:19:08.247 --> 00:19:09.748
If you only say "skylight,"

00:19:09.748 --> 00:19:11.250
people

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.018
might not know it's a roof

00:19:13.018 --> 00:19:14.186
window

00:19:14.186 --> 00:19:15.554
and think it's a side

00:19:15.554 --> 00:19:16.788
window. A roof

00:19:16.788 --> 00:19:18.323
ventilation window

00:19:18.323 --> 00:19:21.026
doesn't actually provide light.

00:19:21.026 --> 00:19:22.261
If you have any good ideas,

00:19:22.261 --> 00:19:23.328
please provide them to the shop owner.

